16:09.830 --> 16:13.790
It's too much of a burden to combine
advance magic and the Aria.

16:13.790 --> 16:17.200
If you keep this up,
you won't be able to talk anymore.

16:17.200 --> 16:20.660
She won't be able to talk...?

16:25.540 --> 16:28.250
With this, I'll be able to further
the Aria's healing properties...

16:43.370 --> 16:46.580
Wait, does that song...

16:46.580 --> 16:49.910
No... Onee-chan, you can't...

16:53.620 --> 16:55.290
Are you okay?

16:55.290 --> 16:59.120
I'm fine. I just have a little cough.

16:59.120 --> 17:01.580
I'll sing more for you now.

17:01.580 --> 17:05.330
I love your songs, Onee-chan!

17:10.200 --> 17:13.080
Stop! Stop singing!

17:13.080 --> 17:18.250
Please don't sing anymore, Onee-chan!

17:23.500 --> 17:24.330
Tia!

17:24.330 --> 17:25.330
—Tiara!
—Tia-chan!
—Tiara-san!

17:27.450 --> 17:30.910
Onee-chan... Your voice...

17:30.910 --> 17:33.040
So you found out...

17:33.040 --> 17:35.750
What happened?

17:35.750 --> 17:41.370
My sister... Her voice is
almost completely gone.

17:41.370 --> 17:44.330
Because she cured my illness...

17:44.330 --> 17:45.500
Her voice?

17:45.500 --> 17:47.290
It's gone?

17:47.290 --> 17:49.290
But I mean, even now...

17:49.290 --> 17:52.830
She is indeed speaking,
but the wavelength from her voice is...

17:52.830 --> 17:55.330
That's a Berry Board!

17:55.330 --> 17:56.310
The one you made?

17:56.310 --> 17:59.580
It turns your thoughts into words...

17:59.580 --> 18:01.750
I made a few modifications.

18:01.750 --> 18:03.910
W-Wow...

18:03.910 --> 18:09.910
Because of this, I'm able to at least
turn my thoughts into sound.

18:09.910 --> 18:12.950
I'm not sure how much longer
I'll be able to use my throat.

18:12.950 --> 18:14.580
No...

18:14.580 --> 18:16.120
I'm so sorry!

18:16.120 --> 18:19.450
It's all my fault! I'm so sorry!

18:19.450 --> 18:21.040
Please don't blame yourself.

18:21.040 --> 18:22.040
But...

18:22.040 --> 18:24.750
I should be the one apologizing.

18:24.750 --> 18:26.790
I didn't want to put you through this.

18:28.330 --> 18:32.040
Is this also why you became distant with me?

18:51.620 --> 18:55.790
You must've been protecting me
this whole time...

18:55.790 --> 19:00.200
Don't be sad. This was my own decision.

19:02.620 --> 19:05.700
I'll continue to protect you.

19:07.370 --> 19:08.910
So let's go home...

19:13.000 --> 19:14.700
Ti... ara...?

19:16.080 --> 19:18.950
No... That's not it.

19:20.330 --> 19:24.540
You had been protecting me this whole time.

19:25.950 --> 19:30.450
So now, I'm going to protect you!

19:30.450 --> 19:32.200
Protect me?

19:32.200 --> 19:35.200
I'm going to get your voice back!

19:35.200 --> 19:40.910
You mustn't! Even if you were to acquire
the powers of Aria, then you'd just...

19:40.910 --> 19:45.870
No. I'm going to find a different Aria.

19:45.870 --> 19:47.620
A different Aria?

19:47.620 --> 19:51.750
Because I'm not you.

19:51.750 --> 19:53.790
But you can't with your mana!

19:53.790 --> 19:58.500
We won't know if we don't try. And...

19:58.500 --> 20:00.290
...I have all of them.

20:00.290 --> 20:02.200
Even if you can't do it alone...

20:02.200 --> 20:04.000
With all five of us...

20:04.000 --> 20:05.950
...we can do anything!

20:05.950 --> 20:07.660
Because we're LiGHTs.

20:08.790 --> 20:10.120
LiGHTs...

20:10.120 --> 20:12.250
I'll also help.

20:12.250 --> 20:14.410
Yue... You, too?

20:14.410 --> 20:17.160
Please let me repay you.

20:17.160 --> 20:19.500
We're in on this, too!

20:19.500 --> 20:22.870
What would you do without us?

20:22.870 --> 20:24.200
Thank you...

20:24.200 --> 20:27.080
Like we can just stand around
after hearing all of this.

20:27.080 --> 20:29.330
We'll help you out whenever!

20:29.330 --> 20:31.040
We will, too.

20:31.040 --> 20:33.290
Don't hesitate to ask for help at any time.

20:33.290 --> 20:35.450
What a rockin' development!

20:35.450 --> 20:37.330
You just have to use that word.

20:37.330 --> 20:41.580
Looks like I'm gonna have to do this for Eliza.

20:41.580 --> 20:43.750
I guess I wouldn't mind
using this for a favour later.

20:43.750 --> 20:47.000
I'd appreciate it if you didn't forget about us.

20:47.000 --> 20:50.660
We always help each other out. That's the code.

20:50.660 --> 20:52.290
You can count on us!

20:52.290 --> 20:56.200
I'll do whatever Emilia-san tells me to.

20:56.200 --> 20:57.410
Everyone...

21:00.870 --> 21:02.450
All right.

21:02.450 --> 21:04.620
I'll look forward to that day.

21:04.620 --> 21:08.450
Onee-chan... Yeah. Wait for us.

21:08.450 --> 21:11.870
Looks like you found some wonderful friends.

21:11.870 --> 21:14.540
I don't know what I'd do without them.

21:20.260 --> 21:26.340
tatoeba taisetsu na

21:20.260 --> 21:32.010
Even if the most important thing alone is not protected

21:26.340 --> 21:32.820
mono sae mamorezu ni

21:32.820 --> 21:39.310
doushiyou mo nai kurai

21:32.820 --> 21:44.580
No matter how uncontrollably my heart is mourning

21:39.310 --> 21:44.580
kokoro ga nageite mo

21:44.580 --> 21:48.840
nakusanai de iyou

21:44.580 --> 21:48.840
Let's not lose

21:48.840 --> 21:52.080
shiawase mo itami mo

21:48.840 --> 21:58.360
If we can share all of our happiness and pain

21:52.080 --> 21:58.360
subete wa kachi aetara

22:02.420 --> 22:07.690
onaji sora no shita

22:02.420 --> 22:07.690
Beneath the same sky

22:07.690 --> 22:13.770
tomoni me wo toji inorou

22:07.690 --> 22:13.770
Let's close our eyes and pray!

22:13.770 --> 22:21.470
kibou ni michita yoake e

22:13.770 --> 22:21.470
Towards a dawn filled with hope

22:24.610 --> 22:30.940
kibou kanadeyou

22:24.610 --> 22:37.830
O hope, echo on with this never-ending song

22:30.940 --> 22:37.830
owari no nai kono uta wo

22:37.830 --> 22:43.920
sakasou sono mune ni

22:37.830 --> 22:49.590
Blossom within that bosom so that someday it can nest in it

22:43.920 --> 22:49.590
itsu no hi mo yori someru you ni

22:49.590 --> 22:56.080
nagareru ai ni kono te wo

22:49.590 --> 22:56.080
With flowing love, let's walk hand in hand

22:56.080 --> 23:04.190
kasanete tomoni ayumou

22:56.080 --> 23:04.190
Together, once again

23:04.190 --> 23:09.740
michibiku hikari yo

23:04.190 --> 23:09.740
Oh, guiding light

23:09.740 --> 23:15.820
yatsuraka na yume no saki e

23:09.740 --> 23:15.820
guide us towards a peaceful dream

23:15.820 --> 23:27.570
kibou no iro ni somatte

23:15.820 --> 23:27.570
Dye us in the colour of hope
